const pages=[['overview','◫','总览'],['library','▤','配置库'],['harnesses','⌘','本机 AI 工具'],['projects','▱','项目'],['changes','⇄','同步变更'],['history','◷','历史'],['settings','⚙','设置']];
const assets=[['code-review','Skills','全局','Claude Code、Codex','全部功能可用','团队代码审查规范，覆盖安全、测试与维护性。'],['AGENTS.md','Instructions','RuleSwitch','Codex','格式调整后可用','项目架构边界、工作原则与验证要求。'],['context7','MCP','全局','3 个 AI 工具','格式调整后可用','为开发任务提供最新的库文档与示例。'],['pre-commit','Hooks','RuleSwitch','Claude Code','部分功能不可用','提交前的检查命令与失败处理策略。'],['typescript-style','Rules','全局','4 个 AI 工具','格式调整后可用','TypeScript 编码约定与类型安全规则。'],['test-runner','Commands','全局','Claude Code','全部功能可用','运行目标测试并归纳失败原因。'],['engineering','Prompts / Agents','全局','Codex','全部功能可用','工程任务角色与输出约定。'],['editor-defaults','Settings','全局','Cursor','原生','编辑器行为与项目配置。'],['opencode.json','Native','全局','OpenCode','原生','保留工具专属配置与未知字段。']];
assets.push(['test-first','Skills','全局','Claude Code、Codex','全部功能可用','先定位失败用例，再修复并检查回归。'],['frontend-design','Skills','全局','Claude Code、Codex','全部功能可用','前端视觉设计与界面实现规范。'],['github','MCP','全局','Claude Code、Codex','格式调整后可用','查询仓库、Issue 与 Pull Request。']);
let page='overview',scope='全部作用域',assetIndex=0,query='',sourceTab='内容',kindFilter='所有类型',selectedHarness=null,harnessScope='全局',selectedProject=null;
const foldedGroups=new Set();
const typeLabels={'Skills':'技能 Skills','MCP':'工具服务 MCP','Instructions':'指令文件','Rules':'规则','Hooks':'自动执行 Hooks','Commands':'快捷命令','Prompts / Agents':'提示词与角色','Settings':'设置','Native':'工具专用配置'};
const harnessNames=['Claude Code','Codex','Cursor','OpenCode'];
Object.keys(typeLabels).filter(k=>k!=='Skills'&&k!=='MCP').forEach(k=>foldedGroups.add(k));
const escapeHtml=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const operationLabels={CREATE:'新增',MODIFY:'修改',DELETE:'删除', 'NO-OP':'无需修改',BLOCKED:'暂不能应用',DEGRADED:'部分功能不可用'};
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),tag=t=>`<span class="tag">${t}</span>`,btn=(text,action,cls='')=>`<button class="${cls}" data-action="${action}">${text}</button>`;
const head=(title,sub,actions='')=>`<div class="page-head"><div><h1>${title}</h1><p class="subtitle">${sub}</p></div><div class="actions">${actions}</div></div>`;
const section=(title,action='')=>`<div class="section-head"><h2>${title}</h2>${action}</div>`;
function navigate(next){page=next;query='';if(next==='harnesses')selectedHarness=null;if(next==='projects')selectedProject=null;render()}
const harnessCatalog=[{name:'Claude Code',icon:'✳'},{name:'Codex',icon:'⌘'},{name:'Cursor',icon:'⌁'},{name:'OpenCode',icon:'▣'},{name:'Gemini CLI',icon:'✦'},{name:'Windsurf',icon:'≈'},{name:'Cline',icon:'◉'}];
const manualHarnesses=[];
function harnessIcon(name){return manualHarnesses.find(x=>x.name===name)?.icon||harnessCatalog.find(x=>x.name===name)?.icon||'◇'}
function registerHarness(name,icon,path,type){name=name.trim();if(!name)return '请输入工具名称';if(harnessNames.some(n=>n.toLowerCase()===name.toLowerCase()))return '这个工具已存在';if(!icon.trim())icon='◇';const match=harnessCatalog.find(x=>x.name.toLowerCase()===name.toLowerCase());const item={name:match?.name||name,icon:icon.trim(),path:path.trim(),type};manualHarnesses.push(item);harnessNames.push(item.name);localSamples[item.name]=[];return ''}
function addHarness(){modal('新增 AI 工具','选择常见工具，或完全自定义。',`<div class="setup-toolbar"><h3>常见工具</h3><span class="muted">选择后匹配名称与图标</span></div><div class="setup-tools">${harnessCatalog.map(x=>`<button data-harness-preset="${x.name}" class="setup-tool"><span class="harness-mark">${x.icon}</span><strong>${x.name}</strong></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="setup-range"><h3>自定义工具信息</h3><span class="muted">所有字段均可修改</span></div><div class="apply-selection" style="margin-top:16px"><label>名称<input id="harness-name" aria-label="工具名称" placeholder="例如 My Agent" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:9px"></label><label>图标<input id="harness-icon" aria-label="工具图标" value="◇" placeholder="字母、符号或 Emoji" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:9px"></label></div><label>本机配置目录<input id="harness-path" aria-label="本机配置目录" placeholder="例如 ~/.my-agent（可稍后填写）" style="display:block;width:100%;padding:9px"></label><label>配置格式<select id="harness-format" style="margin-left:12px"><option>自定义 / 原始文件</option><option>Markdown</option><option>JSON</option><option>TOML</option><option>YAML</option></select></label><p id="harness-error" class="warning" role="alert"></p><p class="subtitle">新增用于登记本机工具，不等于已安装或已支持配置转换。自定义工具需设置配置映射后才能自动应用。</p>`,btn('添加工具','save-harness','primary'))}
function saveHarness(){const error=registerHarness($('#harness-name').value,$('#harness-icon').value,$('#harness-path').value,$('#harness-format').value);if(error){$('#harness-error').textContent=error;return}$('#dialog').close();render();toast('已添加工具（本次原型会话）；配置映射待设置')}
function harnessSettings(){return section('AI 工具管理',btn('＋ 新增工具','add-harness','small'))+`<div class="panel">${harnessNames.map(n=>{const custom=manualHarnesses.find(x=>x.name===n);return `<div class="setting-row"><div><h3>${escapeHtml(harnessIcon(n))} ${escapeHtml(n)}</h3><small>${custom?escapeHtml(custom.path||'配置目录待填写')+' · '+escapeHtml(custom.type):'内置工具 · 名称与图标已匹配'}</small></div>${tag(custom?'已登记 · 映射待设置':'内置')}</div>`}).join('')}</div>`}
function render(){ $('#nav').innerHTML=pages.map(([id,icon,label])=>`<button data-page="${id}" class="${page===id?'active':''}" ${page===id?'aria-current="page"':''}><span class="nav-icon">${icon}</span><span class="nav-label">${label}</span>${id==='changes'?'<span class="count">'+scChangeCount()+'</span>':''}</button>`).join('');$('#breadcrumb').innerHTML=`工作空间 <span>/</span> ${pages.find(p=>p[0]===page)[2]}`;$('#main').innerHTML=views[page](); }
function harnessRow(name,mark,state,detail,cls=''){return `<div class="row"><span class="harness-mark ${cls}">${mark}</span><div><strong>${escapeHtml(name)}</strong><small>${detail}</small></div><div class="end"><span class="status ${state==='本地修改'||state==='有冲突'?'warning':''}">${state==='已同步'?'✓':'◌'} ${state}</span><small>全局 + 项目</small></div></div>`}
const views={
overview:()=>head('你的 Agent 环境','配置集中管理，工作习惯随设备同步。',btn('↻ 检查更新','scan')+btn('恢复到本机','restore-device','primary'))+`<div class="banner"><span class="banner-icon">⇄</span><div><h3>3 项本地修改尚未保存到配置库</h3><p>Claude Code 与 Codex 的配置已变更。查看差异后，再保存到配置仓库。</p></div><div class="actions">${btn('查看变更','changes','small')}</div></div>${section('配置仓库', '<span class="status">✓ 远端已同步</span>')}<div class="panel repo-summary"><div><b>agent-environment</b><small>github.com / dongxin / agent-environment</small><small>⑂ main &nbsp; · &nbsp; 最近更新 12 分钟前</small></div><div><b class="big">32 <span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">项配置</span></b><small>全局 24 &nbsp; 项目 8</small></div><div><b class="big">4 <span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">个 AI 工具</span></b><small>2 个已同步 &nbsp; 2 个待处理</small></div></div><div class="two-col"><section>${section('本机 AI 工具',btn('管理本机工具','harnesses','quiet small'))}<div class="panel">${harnessRow('Claude Code','✳','本地修改','12 项配置 · 2 个项目','claude')}${harnessRow('Codex','⌘','有冲突','10 项配置 · 2 个项目','codex')}${harnessRow('Cursor','⌁','已同步','8 项配置 · 1 个项目')}${harnessRow('OpenCode','▣','已同步','6 项配置 · 全局')}<div class="section-foot">配置状态基于最近扫描；实际应用前将重新检查。</div></div></section><section>${section('最近活动',btn('全部历史','history','quiet small'))}<div class="panel activity"><div class="row"><span class="activity-icon">✓</span><div><strong>code-review 已应用到 Codex</strong><small>全局 · 2 个文件 · 验证通过</small></div><time>10:36</time></div><div class="row"><span class="activity-icon">⑂</span><div><strong>配置仓库已更新</strong><small>main · 8c4f2a1 · 快进同步</small></div><time>10:30</time></div><div class="row"><span class="activity-icon">▱</span><div><strong>RuleSwitch 项目已绑定</strong><small>Claude Code、Codex</small></div><time>09:54</time></div><div class="row"><span class="activity-icon warning">◌</span><div><strong>检测到本地修改</strong><small>Claude Code · code-review</small></div><time>09:42</time></div></div>${section('绑定的项目',btn('全部项目','projects','quiet small'))}<div class="panel"><div class="row"><span class="harness-mark">▱</span><div><strong>RuleSwitch</strong><small>工程开发 配置组合 · 2 个 AI 工具</small></div><span class="end status warning">1 项冲突</span></div><div class="row"><span class="harness-mark">▱</span><div><strong>RHIZA</strong><small>工程开发 配置组合 · 2 个 AI 工具</small></div><span class="end status">✓ 已同步</span></div></div></section></div>`,
library:()=>{syncLibrarySelection();return head('配置库','当前 Git 仓库、当前分支的最新配置。应用后，工具和项目的本地设置才会更新。',btn('从本机导入','import')+btn('新建配置','create','primary'))+sourceBar('Git 仓库最新配置','agent-environment / main','已保存版本 8c4f2a1 · 当前分支最新提交 · 与远端一致')+`<div class="tabs">${['全部作用域','全局','RuleSwitch','RHIZA'].map(t=>`<button data-scope="${t}" class="${scope===t?'active':''}">${t==='全部作用域'?'全部范围':t==='全局'?'全局共享':t}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="filters"><input id="asset-search" aria-label="搜索配置" placeholder="⌕ 搜索仓库配置…" value="${escapeHtml(query)}"><select id="kind-filter" aria-label="配置类型"><option>所有类型</option>${Object.keys(typeLabels).map(k=>`<option value="${k}" ${kindFilter===k?'selected':''}>${typeLabels[k]}</option>`).join('')}</select>${btn('全部折叠','fold-all','quiet small')}${btn('全部展开','unfold-all','quiet small')}<span class="muted" id="asset-count">${filteredAssets().length} 项配置</span></div><div class="library-layout"><div id="asset-rows" class="asset-groups">${assetRows()}</div><aside class="panel inspector" id="inspector">${inspector()}</aside></div>`},
harnesses:()=>harnessView(),
projects:()=>projectView(),
changes:()=>sourceControlView(),
history:()=>head('历史','Git 版本与本机应用记录分开保留，恢复前会生成新的预览。')+`<div class="tabs"><button class="active" data-history="device">本机事务</button><button data-history="git">Git 版本</button></div><div id="history-content">${historyTable(false)}</div>`,
settings:()=>head('设置','仓库、配置组合 与本机偏好。')+`<div class="settings">${harnessSettings()}${section('配置仓库')}<div class="panel"><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>agent-environment</h3><small>github.com/dongxin/agent-environment · main</small></div>${btn('管理连接','connect','small')}</div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>同步策略</h3><small>仅快进；分叉时阻止同步，交由你明确处理。</small></div>${tag('Fast-forward only')}</div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>默认 配置组合</h3><small>决定全局配置的默认组合。</small></div><select aria-label="默认 配置组合"><option>工程开发</option><option>轻量模式</option></select></div></div>${section('设备与安全')}<div class="panel"><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>凭据引用</h3><small>配置仓库只保存引用；密钥由本机 Keychain 或环境变量解析。</small></div>${btn('查看引用','secrets','small')}</div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>应用前备份</h3><small>自动备份受影响配置，写入后重新验证。</small></div><span class="status">始终开启</span></div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>恢复中心</h3><small>1 项未完成事务需要检查。</small></div>${btn('查看事务','recovery','small')}</div></div>${section('外观')}<div class="panel setting-row"><div><h3>主题</h3><small>浅色与深色共用同一套语义与布局。</small></div>${btn('切换明暗','theme','small')}</div></div>`
};
function sourceBar(origin,name,status){return `<div class="source-bar"><span class="source-origin">${origin}</span><strong>${name}</strong><span class="muted">${status}</span></div>`}
function filteredAssets(){return assets.map((a,i)=>({a,i})).filter(({a})=>(scope==='全部作用域'||a[2]===scope)&&(kindFilter==='所有类型'||a[1]===kindFilter)&&a[0].toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()))}
function syncLibrarySelection(){const list=filteredAssets();if(!list.some(x=>x.i===assetIndex))assetIndex=list[0]?.i??null}
function refreshLibrary(){syncLibrarySelection();$('#asset-rows').innerHTML=assetRows();$('#inspector').innerHTML=inspector();$('#asset-count').textContent=filteredAssets().length+' 项配置'}
function assetRows(){const list=filteredAssets();return Object.keys(typeLabels).map(kind=>{const group=list.filter(x=>x.a[1]===kind);if(!group.length)return '';return `<details class="asset-group panel" data-kind="${kind}" ${!foldedGroups.has(kind)?'open':''}><summary><span>${typeLabels[kind]}</span><span class="group-count">${group.length}</span></summary><div class="group-columns"><span>配置名称</span><span>使用范围</span><span>更新</span></div>${group.map(({a,i})=>`<button class="asset-row ${i===assetIndex?'selected':''}" data-asset="${i}" aria-pressed="${i===assetIndex}"><span class="asset-name"><span class="asset-glyph">${kind==='Skills'?'◈':'≡'}</span><span><strong>${a[0]}</strong><small>${a[5]}</small></span></span><span class="muted">${a[2]==='全局'?'全局共享':a[2]}</span><span class="muted">今天</span></button>`).join('')}</details>`}).join('')||'<div class="panel empty"><h2>没有匹配的仓库配置</h2><p>调整搜索词、类型或使用范围。</p></div>'}
function inspector(){if(assetIndex===null)return '<div><h2>选择一项配置</h2><p>查看仓库内容及可安装的工具。</p></div>';const a=assets[assetIndex];return `<div>${tag('Git 仓库最新配置')}<h2>${a[0]}</h2><p>${a[5]}</p><div class="detail-title">仓库中的配置</div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">类型</span><span>${typeLabels[a[1]]}</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">使用范围</span><span>${a[2]==='全局'?'全局共享':a[2]}</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">保存方式</span><span>${a[1]==='Skills'?'整个技能文件夹':a[1]==='Native'?'工具专用文件':'配置内容'}</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">仓库版本</span><span>8c4f2a1</span></div>${btn('查看仓库内容','content','quiet small')}<div class="actions">${btn('编辑仓库配置','repo-edit','small')}${btn('从仓库删除','repo-delete','small')}</div></div><div><div class="detail-title">应用到本机工具 / 项目</div><p>安装前会显示实际差异。</p><div class="detail-line"><span>Claude Code</span><span class="status">可完整使用</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span>Codex</span><span class="${a[1]==='Hooks'?'muted':'status'}">${a[1]==='Hooks'?'暂不支持':'可完整使用'}</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span>Cursor</span><span class="muted">${a[1]==='Hooks'?'暂不支持':'需调整格式，功能不变'}</span></div>${btn('应用到工具 / 项目…','project-asset','primary')}</div>`}
const localSamples={
'Claude Code':[{name:'code-review',kind:'Skills',scope:'全局',file:'~/.claude/skills/code-review/SKILL.md',state:'本机已修改',origin:'配置库',index:0},{name:'context7',kind:'MCP',scope:'全局',file:'~/.claude.json · mcpServers.context7',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'配置库',index:2},{name:'personal-notes',kind:'Skills',scope:'全局',file:'~/.claude/skills/personal-notes/SKILL.md',state:'仅在本机',origin:'未加入配置库',index:null},{name:'CLAUDE.md',kind:'Instructions',scope:'RuleSwitch',file:'RuleSwitch / CLAUDE.md',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'项目设置',index:1},{name:'pre-commit',kind:'Hooks',scope:'RuleSwitch',file:'RuleSwitch / .claude/settings.json',state:'需要恢复',origin:'项目设置',index:3}],
'Codex':[{name:'code-review',kind:'Skills',scope:'全局',file:'~/.codex/skills/code-review/SKILL.md',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'配置库',index:0},{name:'context7',kind:'MCP',scope:'全局',file:'~/.codex/config.toml · mcp_servers.context7',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'配置库',index:2},{name:'AGENTS.md',kind:'Instructions',scope:'RuleSwitch',file:'RuleSwitch / AGENTS.md',state:'双方均有修改',origin:'项目设置',index:1}],
'Cursor':[{name:'typescript-style',kind:'Rules',scope:'全局',file:'Cursor / 用户规则',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'配置库',index:4},{name:'editor-defaults',kind:'Settings',scope:'全局',file:'Cursor / settings.json',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'配置库',index:7}],
'OpenCode':[{name:'opencode.json',kind:'Native',scope:'全局',file:'~/.config/opencode/opencode.json',state:'与仓库一致',origin:'配置库',index:8}]
};
function toolButton(text,name,action='open-harness',cls='small'){return `<button class="${cls}" data-${action}="${escapeHtml(name)}">${text}</button>`}
function harnessView(){if(!selectedHarness)return head('本机 AI 工具','这台设备上各 AI 工具当前的本地设置。按工具查看全局与项目配置，并与 Git 配置库比较。',btn('↻ 重新检测','scan')+btn('配置新工具 / 新设备','setup-harness','primary'))+sourceBar('本机设备','Dongxin’s Mac mini','工具本地设置 · 最近扫描 10:42 · 本机修改尚未自动入库')+`<div class="compat-grid">${harnessNames.map((name,i)=>`<section class="panel harness-panel">${harnessRow(name,escapeHtml(harnessIcon(name)),i===0?'本地修改':i===1?'有冲突':'已同步',localSamples[name].length+' 项示例配置 · '+(manualHarnesses.some(x=>x.name===name)?'手动登记':'已安装'),i===0?'claude':'')}<div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">全局配置</span><span>${localSamples[name].filter(x=>x.scope==='全局').length} 项</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">项目配置</span><span>${localSamples[name].filter(x=>x.scope!=='全局').length} 项</span></div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">与仓库的关系</span><span>${i===0?'含本机修改与未入库配置':i===1?'项目中有冲突':'示例配置一致'}</span></div><div class="section-foot"><span>本机配置 · 示例</span>${toolButton('查看本机配置',name)}</div></section>`).join('')}</div>`;
const configs=localSamples[selectedHarness].filter(x=>x.scope===harnessScope);return head(selectedHarness+' · 本机配置','这里显示工具当前读取的文件。本机修改不会自动保存到 Git。',btn('← 所有工具','all-harnesses')+btn('↻ 重新扫描','scan')+btn('同步修改到其他工具 / 远端…','sync-harness','primary'))+sourceBar('本机配置',selectedHarness+' / '+harnessScope,'Dongxin’s Mac mini · 与仓库版本分别展示')+`<div class="tabs">${['全局','RuleSwitch','RHIZA'].map(t=>`<button data-local-scope="${t}" class="${harnessScope===t?'active':''}">${t==='全局'?'全局配置':t+' 项目'}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="panel"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>本机配置</th><th>与配置库的关系</th><th>最初来源（非当前内容）</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${configs.map(x=>{const i=localSamples[selectedHarness].indexOf(x);return `<tr><td>${x.name}<small>${typeLabels[x.kind]} · ${x.file}</small></td><td><span class="${x.state==='与仓库一致'?'status':'warning'}">${x.state}</span></td><td>${x.origin}</td><td><div class="actions"><button class="small" data-local-config="${i}">查看本机内容</button>${x.state==='双方均有修改'?btn('处理冲突','conflict','small'):x.state==='需要恢复'?btn('检查恢复','recovery','small'):x.state==='本机已修改'||x.index===null?`<button class="small" data-local-save="${i}">保存到配置库…</button>`:''}</div></td></tr>`}).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="4"><div class="empty"><h2>这个范围没有本机配置</h2><p>可以从配置库选择配置，安装到此工具。</p></div></td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><p class="subtitle">“仅在本机”的配置没有纳入同步；安装仓库配置时默认保留。</p>`}
function projectView(){if(!selectedProject)return head('项目','这台设备上各项目当前的本地设置。按项目查看目录、关联工具与项目专属配置。',btn('绑定项目','bind','primary'))+sourceBar('项目本地设置','Dongxin’s Mac mini / 项目目录','来自本机项目 · Git 配置库中的版本单独管理')+`<div class="panel">${[['RuleSwitch','projects/ruleswitch','工程开发','2 项项目配置','1 项冲突'],['RHIZA','projects/RHIZA','工程开发','继承全局配置','已同步']].map(([n,path,profile,count,state])=>`<div class="project-row"><div><h2>▱ &nbsp;${n}</h2><small>本机绑定：${path}</small></div><div>${profile}<small>${count}</small></div><div>Claude Code / Codex<small class="${state==='已同步'?'status':'warning'}">${state}</small></div><button class="small" data-project="${n}">管理项目</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`;
return head(selectedProject,'当前本机项目的设置与配置文件。这里按项目汇总；本机 AI 工具页面按工具查看同一批本地文件。',btn('← 所有项目','all-projects')+btn('预览项目应用','project-preview','primary'))+sourceBar('项目本地设置',selectedProject,'本机目录绑定已确认 · 当前本地设置 · 最近扫描 10:42')+`<div class="project-detail-layout"><section>${section('目录与配置组合')}<div class="panel"><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>本机目录</h3><small>projects/${selectedProject==='RuleSwitch'?'ruleswitch':'RHIZA'} · 仅在本机保存</small></div>${btn('更换绑定','bind','small')}</div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>使用的配置组合</h3><small>工程开发 · 继承全局共享配置</small></div>${btn('调整组合','project-profile','small')}</div></div>${section('这个项目使用的 AI 工具')}<div class="panel">${['Claude Code','Codex'].map(n=>`<div class="row"><strong>${n}</strong><span class="muted">已关联</span><span class="end">${toolButton('查看项目实际配置',n,'project-tool')}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></section><section>${section('项目本地文件')}<div class="panel">${['Claude Code','Codex'].flatMap(n=>localSamples[n].filter(x=>x.scope===selectedProject).map(x=>`<div class="row"><div><strong>${x.name}</strong><small>${n} · ${x.file}</small></div><span class="end ${x.state==='与仓库一致'?'status':'warning'}">${x.state}</span></div>`)).join('')||'<div class="row"><div><strong>暂无项目专属文件</strong><small>当前沿用关联工具的全局本地设置。</small></div></div>'}</div>${section('当前本地配置与使用关系')}<div class="panel"><div class="row"><div><strong>继承全局配置</strong><small>code-review · context7 · typescript-style</small></div>${tag('全局共享')}</div>${selectedProject==='RuleSwitch'?'<div class="row"><div><strong>AGENTS.md</strong><small>项目专属指令，补充全局工作规范。</small></div>'+tag('项目补充')+'</div><div class="row"><div><strong>pre-commit</strong><small>此项目的提交检查替代全局默认 Hook。</small></div>'+tag('项目覆盖')+'</div>':'<div class="row"><div><strong>没有项目专属配置</strong><small>当前使用全局配置与“工程开发”组合。</small></div></div>'}<div class="section-foot">同级配置无法确定优先级时，必须先处理冲突。</div></div>${btn('为项目选择仓库配置…','project-config','quiet small')}</section></div>`}
function localContent(i){const x=localSamples[selectedHarness][i];modal(x.name,'本机内容 · '+selectedHarness+' · '+x.scope,sourceBar('本机文件',x.file,x.state)+`<pre class="code">${escapeHtml(x.kind==='MCP'?'server: context7\ncredential: CONTEXT7_API_KEY (引用)':x.name==='code-review'?'# Code review\nReview correctness and tests.\nPrioritize actionable findings.\nCheck security boundaries.':x.name+'\n这是此工具在本机使用的配置内容示例。')}</pre><p class="subtitle">${x.state==='本机已修改'?'这些修改尚未保存到 Git。':x.index===null?'此配置仅在本机，尚未加入配置库。':'本机文件与仓库文件分别管理。'}</p>`)}
function historyTable(git){return `<div class="panel"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>${git?'提交':'操作'}</th><th>范围</th><th>结果</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${(git?[['10:30','8c4f2a1 · 更新 TypeScript 规则','main','已发布'],['昨天','4e712bd · 新增 code-review','main','已发布']]:[['10:36','应用 code-review','Codex · 全局','验证通过'],['09:54','应用项目配置','Claude Code · RuleSwitch','验证通过'],['昨天','恢复 context7','Claude Code · 全局','已恢复'],['昨天','应用 pre-commit','Claude Code · RuleSwitch','需要恢复']]).map(([t,o,s,r])=>`<tr><td>${t}</td><td>${o}<small>${git?'配置仓库版本':'快照完整 · 受影响配置已备份'}</small></td><td>${s}</td><td><span class="${r==='需要恢复'?'warning':'status'}">${r}</span></td><td>${btn(r==='需要恢复'?'检查':'恢复预览',r==='需要恢复'?'recovery':'restore-preview','small')}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`}
function toast(t){$('#toast').textContent=t;$('#toast').style.display='block';clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').style.display='none',3500)}
function modal(title,sub,body,foot=''){if($('#dialog').open)$('#dialog').close(); $('#dialog-content').innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><div><h2 id="dialog-title">${title}</h2><p class="subtitle">${sub}</p></div>${btn('×','close','icon-button')}</div><div class="dialog-body">${body}</div><div class="dialog-foot"><small>设计原型：操作仅演示界面，不读写真实配置。</small><div class="actions">${btn('取消','close')}${foot}</div></div>`;$('#dialog').showModal()}
let applyDraft={asset:0,tools:['Codex'],scopes:['全局'],mode:'merge',overrides:{}};
const applyModeLabels={merge:'合并 / 新增',overwrite:'覆盖',add:'仅新增'};
function applicationRows(){const a=assets[applyDraft.asset];return applyDraft.scopes.flatMap(range=>applyDraft.tools.map(tool=>{const key=range+' / '+tool;const mode=applyDraft.overrides[key]||applyDraft.mode;const existing=localSamples[tool].find(x=>x.scope===range&&(x.index===applyDraft.asset||x.name===a[0]));let state=existing?'修改':'新增',reason=existing?'更新同名配置':'目标尚无同名配置';if(manualHarnesses.some(x=>x.name===tool)){state='阻止';reason='手动登记工具尚未设置配置映射'}else if(range!=='全局'&&!['Claude Code','Codex'].includes(tool)){state='阻止';reason='此工具尚未关联到该项目'}else if(a[1]==='Hooks'&&tool!=='Claude Code'){state='阻止';reason='此示例中该工具不支持这类自动执行配置'}else if(a[1]==='Native'&&tool!=='OpenCode'){state='阻止';reason='工具专用配置不能直接用于其他工具'}else if(a[2]!=='全局'&&range!==a[2]){state='阻止';reason='项目专属配置只能应用到原项目'}else if(existing&&mode==='add'){state='跳过';reason='已有同名配置，保留本机内容'}else if(existing&&mode==='merge'&&!['MCP','Settings'].includes(a[1])){state='阻止';reason='此类型不支持自动合并同名内容，请选择覆盖或仅新增'}else if(existing&&mode==='merge'){reason='合并受管理字段；同名字段不同值时需解决冲突'}else if(existing&&mode==='overwrite'){reason='替换这项配置内容；先备份当前版本'}return {key,tool,range,mode,state,reason,existing:!!existing}}))}
function applySelection(){const a=assets[applyDraft.asset];modal('应用配置',a[0]+' · 从 Git 配置库应用到本机',`<div class="steps"><span class="active">选择目标与方式</span><span>›</span><span>逐项预览</span><span>›</span><span>备份与应用</span></div><div class="apply-selection"><fieldset><legend>1. 选择 AI 工具（可多选）</legend>${harnessNames.map(n=>`<label class="apply-choice"><input type="checkbox" data-apply-tool="${escapeHtml(n)}" ${applyDraft.tools.includes(n)?'checked':''}>${n}</label>`).join('')}</fieldset><fieldset><legend>2. 选择应用范围（可多选）</legend>${['全局','RuleSwitch','RHIZA'].map(n=>`<label class="apply-choice"><input type="checkbox" data-apply-scope="${n}" ${applyDraft.scopes.includes(n)?'checked':''} ${a[2]!=='全局'&&n!==a[2]?'disabled':''}><span>${n==='全局'?'工具的全局配置':n+' 项目'}<small>${n==='全局'?'影响此工具的所有项目':'只应用到这个项目的工具配置'}</small></span></label>`).join('')}</fieldset></div><p class="subtitle">所选工具 × 所选范围形成应用目标；未关联或不支持的组合会在预览中明确阻止。</p><fieldset class="apply-modes"><legend>3. 同名配置如何处理</legend>${[['merge','合并 / 新增','没有同名配置时新增；已有配置仅在支持安全合并时合并，冲突不自动覆盖。'],['overwrite','覆盖','用仓库内容替换这项同名配置，先备份；不清空工具或项目的其他配置。'],['add','仅新增','只添加不存在的配置；已有同名配置保持不变。']].map(([v,n,d])=>`<label class="apply-choice"><input type="radio" name="apply-mode" value="${v}" ${applyDraft.mode===v?'checked':''}><span><strong>${n}</strong><small>${d}</small></span></label>`).join('')}</fieldset><div id="apply-selection-summary" class="source-bar"></div>`, '<button class="primary" data-action="apply-plan" id="apply-plan-button">查看应用预览</button>');updateApplySelection()}
function updateApplySelection(){const count=applyDraft.tools.length*applyDraft.scopes.length;$('#apply-selection-summary').textContent=`已选 ${applyDraft.tools.length} 个工具、${applyDraft.scopes.length} 个范围，共 ${count} 个目标 · ${applyModeLabels[applyDraft.mode]}`;$('#apply-plan-button').disabled=count===0}
function applyPlan(){const rows=applicationRows();modal('应用预览',assets[applyDraft.asset][0]+' · Git 版本 8c4f2a1 → 本机目标',`<div class="actions">${btn('← 调整目标','apply-back','small')}<span class="muted">可按目标调整处理方式。所有目标通过检查后才可继续。</span></div><div class="apply-plan-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>应用范围 / 工具</th><th>处理方式</th><th>预计结果</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map((r,i)=>`<tr><td>${r.range==='全局'?'全局配置':r.range+' 项目'}<small>${r.tool}</small></td><td><select data-apply-row="${i}" aria-label="${r.key} 处理方式">${Object.entries(applyModeLabels).map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${r.mode===v?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></td><td><span class="${r.state==='阻止'?'warning':r.state==='跳过'?'muted':'status'}">${r.state}</span></td><td><small>${r.reason}</small></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="summary-strip"><span>${rows.filter(r=>r.state==='新增').length} 项新增</span><span>${rows.filter(r=>r.state==='修改').length} 项修改</span><span>${rows.filter(r=>r.state==='跳过').length} 项跳过</span><span>${rows.filter(r=>r.state==='阻止').length} 项阻止</span></div><p class="subtitle">这里只处理当前选择的配置。不影响其他配置项；合并时保留未涉及字段，覆盖时替换所选配置内容。每个目标分别备份、应用、验证。</p>${rows.some(r=>r.state==='修改'&&r.mode==='overwrite')?'<label class="overwrite-ack"><input type="checkbox" id="apply-overwrite-ack"> 我确认替换上述目标中这项配置的现有内容；应用前保留备份。</label>':''}<p class="subtitle">原型根据固定示例展示计划，没有真实扫描、合并或文件操作。</p>`, '<button class="primary" id="apply-confirm" data-action="apply-demo">演示应用</button>');updateApplyConfirmation()}
function updateApplyConfirmation(){const rows=applicationRows();const needsAck=rows.some(r=>r.state==='修改'&&r.mode==='overwrite');$('#apply-confirm').disabled=!rows.length||rows.some(r=>r.state==='阻止')||!rows.some(r=>r.state==='新增'||r.state==='修改')||(needsAck&&!$('#apply-overwrite-ack')?.checked)}
function applyDemo(){if($('#apply-confirm').disabled)return;const rows=applicationRows();modal('应用结果 · 示例',assets[applyDraft.asset][0]+' · 各目标分别展示',rows.map(r=>`<div class="row"><strong>${r.range} / ${r.tool}</strong><span class="end ${r.state==='跳过'?'muted':'status'}">${r.state==='跳过'?'已跳过，内容保留':'✓ 已备份并验证（演示）'}</span></div>`).join('')+'<p class="subtitle">没有修改真实配置或 Git。应用到本机不等于发布仓库。</p>')}

function preview(mode='apply'){let restoring=mode==='restore', projecting=mode==='project';modal(restoring?'恢复预览':'变更预览',restoring?'恢复 code-review · Codex · 全局':projecting?'code-review · 配置仓库 → Codex':'code-review · Claude Code → 配置仓库',`<div class="steps"><span class="active">计划</span><span>›</span><span class="active">预览</span><span>›</span><span>备份</span><span>›</span><span>应用</span><span>›</span><span>验证</span></div><div class="actions">${tag('修改')}${tag('全局')}${tag('全部功能可用')}<span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">2 个文件 · 无删除 · 未纳管内容保留</span></div><div class="diff"><div><div class="diff-label">当前配置 · SKILL.md</div><pre>  1  # Code review\n  2\n  3  Review correctness and tests.\n<span class="removed">− 4  Report all findings.</span>  5\n  6  Preserve project conventions.</pre></div><div><div class="diff-label">${restoring?'快照配置':'预期配置'} · SKILL.md</div><pre>  1  # Code review\n  2\n  3  Review correctness and tests.\n<span class="added">+ 4  Prioritize actionable findings.\n+ 5  Check security boundaries.\n+ 6  Include regression evidence.</span>  7  Preserve project conventions.</pre></div></div><div class="detail-line"><span class="muted">安全检查</span><span class="status">✓ 已纳管目标 · 预览版本一致</span></div><p class="subtitle">${restoring?'恢复前会备份当前配置，恢复也可撤回。':projecting?'应用前备份目标配置，写入后逐目标验证。':'确认后保存到配置库到本地 Git 工作树；提交与发布将分步确认。'}</p>`,btn(restoring?'演示恢复流程':projecting?'演示应用流程':'演示保存到配置库流程','simulate','primary'))}
function setupHarness(){modal('配置新工具 / 新设备','选择工具与范围，下一步检查配置差异。',`<div class="setup-context"><div><small>当前设备</small><strong>Dongxin’s Mac mini</strong><span>macOS · Apple Silicon</span></div><div><small>配置来源</small><strong>agent-environment / main</strong><span>Git 最新版本 · 8c4f2a1</span></div></div><div class="setup-toolbar"><h3>选择 AI 工具 <span class="muted">可多选</span></h3><div class="actions"><span id="setup-count" class="muted"></span>${btn('全选','setup-all','quiet small')}${btn('反选','setup-invert','quiet small')}</div></div><div class="setup-tools">${harnessNames.map((n,i)=>`<label class="setup-tool"><input type="checkbox" name="setup-tool" value="${escapeHtml(n)}" ${n==='Codex'?'checked':''}><span class="harness-mark">${escapeHtml(harnessIcon(n))}</span><span><strong>${escapeHtml(n)}</strong><small>${manualHarnesses.some(x=>x.name===n)?'已登记 · 映射待设置':'已检测到 · 可配置'}</small></span></label>`).join('')}</div><div class="setup-range"><div><h3>配置范围</h3><p>项目范围会检查本机目录绑定。</p></div><select id="setup-scope" aria-label="配置范围"><option>全局配置</option><option>全局 + RuleSwitch 项目</option><option>全局 + 所有已绑定项目</option></select></div><div class="setup-note"><strong>先检查，再应用</strong><p>从仓库读取 Skills、MCP 与指令，检查工具支持、凭据和同名配置；已有内容先保留，覆盖前会备份。</p><small>未安装的工具需先安装，再重新检测。当前状态为原型示例。</small></div>`, '<button id="setup-next" data-action="setup-plan" class="primary">检查并预览配置 →</button>');updateSetupSelection()}
function updateSetupSelection(){const tools=[...document.querySelectorAll('[name="setup-tool"]')];const count=tools.filter(x=>x.checked).length;$('#setup-count').textContent='已选 '+count+' / '+tools.length;$('#setup-next').disabled=count===0}
function selectSetupTools(invert=false){document.querySelectorAll('[name="setup-tool"]').forEach(x=>{x.checked=invert?!x.checked:true});updateSetupSelection()}
